  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** (as of June 2026), across different categories and budgets:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83c\udfc6 Best Laptop Deals Online (June 2026)\n\n### \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Where to Shop\nYou can find all kinds of deals across a wide range of online retailers such as **Newegg, Walmart, Best Buy, Amazon**, and more. It's also worth checking out deals directly from laptop manufacturers like **Lenovo, HP, and Dell**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcbc Best Overall / Premium Laptop\n**Lenovo Yoga (2-in-1)**\nFeaturing a **14-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED display** with HDR up to 120Hz, an **Intel Core Ultra 7 258V CPU**, **32GB of RAM**, **1TB SSD**, and Intel Arc 140V graphics \u2014 it's one of the best Windows laptops you can get right now. It weighs under three pounds with battery life up to **23 hours**, and its 2-in-1 form factor lets you flip it all the way around to use as a tablet or prop it up like a tent.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfae Best Gaming Laptop Deals\nAn **RTX 5060 Lenovo gaming laptop** is among the best deals of the week \u2014 featuring an **OLED display**, **Ultra 7 chipset**, **32GB of RAM**, and **$400 off**.\n\nFrom Best Buy, top gaming picks include:\n\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16** \u2013 16\" 2.5K OLED, 240Hz, Intel Core Ultra 9 285H, **NVIDIA RTX 5070**, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G14** \u2013 14\" 3K OLED, 120Hz, AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX, **NVIDIA RTX 5080**, 32GB RAM, 2TB SSD\n- **Lenovo Legion Pro 5** \u2013 16\" 2.5K, AMD Ryzen 9 8945HX, **NVIDIA RTX 5060**, 16GB RAM, 1TB SSD\n- **MSI Stealth A18 AI+** \u2013 18\" 240Hz QHD+, AMD Ryzen AI R9-365, **RTX 5080**, 32GB RAM, 1TB SSD\n\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Best Budget Laptop\n**Dell 15 Laptop (Under $500)**\nThe **Dell 15 Laptop** is a great affordable pick, with its **AMD Ryzen 3 7320U** chip well-suited for daily tasks like browsing, streaming, and email.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcda Best Chromebook Deals\nBudget Chromebook options include:\n- **Acer Chromebook 315** \u2013 15.6\" FHD, MediaTek Kompanio 540, 4GB RAM, 64GB/128GB storage\n- **HP 14\" 2-in-1 Chromebook** \u2013 Intel Core N150, 8GB RAM, 64GB eMMC\n- **Lenovo Chromebook Plus 15.3\"** \u2013 2K Touchscreen, Intel Core 3, 8GB RAM, 128GB storage\n- **Acer Chromebook Plus Spin 714** \u2013 14\" WUXGA Touch, Intel Core Ultra 5 115U, 8GB RAM, 256GB SSD\n\n\nChromebooks make great everyday machines \u2014 designed for browsing and email, they use fewer resources and are generally **more affordable** than Windows laptops.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf4e Best MacBook Deals\nYou can save **up to $300 on Apple MacBook Air** \u2014 with deals available on both the **M4 and M5** models right now.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Shopping Tips\n- Whether you're looking for an **affordable Windows machine under $500**, a **blazing fast gaming beast**, or a **portable 2-in-1** for school or work, there are plenty of great choices right now.\n- Aim for at least **8GB of RAM** (16GB is preferable for gaming), and avoid laptops with under **4GB RAM or 128GB SSD storage**.\n\nFor live, updated deals, check out:\n- \ud83d\udd17 [PCWorld Laptop Deals](https://www.pcworld.com/article/550968/best-laptop-deals-3.html)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [Best Buy Laptop Sales](https://www.bestbuy.com/site/all-computers-tablets-on-sale/laptops-on-sale/pcmcat1720704669400.c)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [TechRadar Best Laptop Deals](https://www.techradar.com/news/the-best-laptop-deals)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [HP Weekly Deals](https://www.hp.com/us-en/shop/slp/weekly-deals/laptops)",
